{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20996","headline":"平城下 · 李贺","name":"平城下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饥寒平城下，夜夜守明月。\n别劒无玉花，海风断鬓发。\n塞长连白空，遥见汉旗红。\n青帐吹短笛，烟雾湿昼龙。\n日晚在城上，依稀望城下。\n风吹枯蓬起，城中嘶瘦马。\n借问筑城吏，去关几千里。\n惟愁裹屍归，不惜倒戈死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}